pr.body:
Adds `ROADMAP.md`, the engineering roadmap for the people and AI agents who work on ArzoieMail.

It covers:
- how we work: one PR per change, regression tests, which branch names trigger CI, and the three-database test baseline;
- the settled decisions and the reason for each: PowerShell instead of Active Scripting, .NET 10, SQLite, AES-GCM with DPAPI, the PHP 8.5.12 minimum;
- each Phase 0 and Phase 1 item with its PR, design, data formats and tests;
- the lessons learned, for example that CI runners kill processes when a step ends, that `CreateTables` scripts split statements at blank lines, and that COM classes need `ISupportErrorInfo` for error messages to reach callers;
- the test environments (GitHub Actions, Hyper-V VMs) and the tests known to need the live internet;
- the plan for Phase 1b (web admin) and Phases 2–6, and the open follow-ups.

README now links to it and shows Phase 1 as done and Phase 1b as next. AGENTS.md lists the file and asks that a PR finishing or changing a roadmap item update it.

No code changes. Test VM credentials and personal details are left out.

